      <a href="/demo/summit-hvac/" style="color:var(--su-cyan)">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; <span>Service Area</span>
    </nav>
    <span class="summit-eyebrow">Coverage</span>
    <h1 style="font-family:var(--su-font-display);font-size:clamp(2rem,1.5rem+2vw,3rem);color:var(--su-ink);line-height:1.1;margin:0.5rem 0 1.25rem">Heating &amp; cooling <em style="color:var(--su-cyan);font-style:normal">across the Denver metro.</em></h1>
    <p style="font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.65;color:var(--su-text);max-width:62ch">Same-day service inside the I-25 / I-225 / C-470 loop. Heat-pump installs and mini-splits also available out to Castle Rock, Parker, and Longmont. Click any pin for that area's typical heating-degree days, climate zone, and what we install most.</p>
